        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Advocates Ordinance (Sabah) (Amendment) Act 2016."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/5/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
